---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base
  title="Work | Amaan Omar"
  description="QuickLaunch, Onnu, my advisory work with African startups and ventures, and CreatorConnect."
>
  <div class="container page-head">
    <h1>Work</h1>
    <p class="lede prose">What I build and advise on, newest first. The details follow below.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="container work-log" aria-label="The record">
    <ol class="changelog">
      <li class="now">
        <time>Now</time>
        <div>
          <h3><a href="#quicklaunch">QuickLaunch and Onnu</a></h3>
          <p>I lead the technical side of QuickLaunch with Marcel Manikum as CEO, and I designed and built Onnu, our AI code-audit product.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="tag">Building</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time>Now</time>
        <div>
          <h3><a href="#advisory">Advisory</a></h3>
          <p>I advise African startups and ventures on building with AI.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="tag">Advising</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time datetime="2025">2025</time>
        <div>
          <h3><a href="#quicklaunch">Co-founded QuickLaunch</a></h3>
          <p>I met Marcel Manikum at a networking event, and we started QuickLaunch together.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="tag">Built</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time datetime="2024-05">May 2024</time>
        <div>
          <h3><a href="#creatorconnect">CreatorConnect</a></h3>
          <p>A dashboard for UGC marketing agencies to track TikTok view counts. I built it quickly, before AI coding tools.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="tag">Shipped</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time datetime="2023">2023</time>
        <div>
          <h3>Freelance, full time</h3>
          <p>Gifties, an international gifting platform built on Bubble, and clients in Amsterdam, the US and Dubai. At the end of 2023 I went full time.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="tag">Learned</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="quicklaunch" class="section container"><div class="prose">
    <h2>QuickLaunch</h2>
    <p class="eyebrow">Co-founder and technical lead · 2025 to now</p>
    <p>
      QuickLaunch is the company I co-founded with Marcel Manikum. Marcel is our CEO and I lead everything
      technical. We build software with AI at its core, and we audit and rescue products that were built
      quickly on Lovable, Bolt and Replit.
    </p>
    <p>
      I designed our AI development harnesses: the tooling and guardrails that let AI write code safely and
      consistently. I also built the memory and context management that keeps our AI agents accurate on
      large, real-world codebases.
    </p>
    {/*
      AWAITING AMAAN'S APPROVAL of this wording.
      <p>I built an agentic platform where a fleet of AI agents runs real projects. Each agent has its own job
      and its own memory. They hand work to each other, and they ask me when a decision is mine.</p>
    */}
    <p><a href={SITE.links.quicklaunch} rel="noopener" target="_blank">quicklaunch.dev</a></p>
  </div></section>

  <section id="onnu" class="section container"><div class="prose">
    <h2>Onnu</h2>
    <p>
      Onnu is our AI code-audit product. I designed and built it while QuickLaunch was part of Jasiri
      Talent Investor, Cohort 2 South Africa.
    </p>
    <p>
      First it asks you what your app should do. Then it checks whether it does. You connect GitHub
      read-only and answer questions about your goals and what must never break while Onnu reads the code.
      Then you get every issue in plain English, most dangerous first.
    </p>
    {/* [CONFIRM] link to audit.onnu.ai once Amaan clears the domain. */}
  </div></section>

  <section id="advisory" class="section container"><div class="prose">
    <h2>Advisory</h2>
    <p>
      I advise African startups and ventures on building with AI: which model suits which job, where
      AI-written code tends to break, and how to rescue a product that was built fast.
    </p>
    <p>If that's useful to your team, <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section id="creatorconnect" class="section container"><div class="prose">
    <h2>CreatorConnect</h2>
    <p class="eyebrow">Founder · 2024</p>
    <p>
      In May 2024 I started CreatorConnect, a dashboard for UGC marketing agencies to track TikTok view
      counts. There was no software for it, so I built it, quickly and before AI coding tools. For a few
      months it reached R100,000 a month, about $25,000 in total. Then I burnt out and stopped.
    </p>
  </div></section>
  {/* "Earlier work" list (Gifties, PDF-Parser, Android UI automation) waits on Amaan: keep or drop (open question 4). */}
</Base>

<style>
  .work-log { padding-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .changelog h3 a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .changelog h3 a:hover { color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline; }
  section[id] .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
</style>
